WEBVTT

00:09:30.537 --> 00:09:36.204
deny, attack, reverse the victim
with the offender.

00:09:37.204 --> 00:09:39.121
DARVO sounds like this.

00:09:39.162 --> 00:09:40.412
(Clears throat)

00:09:41.704 --> 00:09:44.579
"Jodi-Ann, this has nothing
to do with your race."

00:09:45.537 --> 00:09:46.787
Deny.

00:09:47.329 --> 00:09:51.246
"You're just being
too sensitive and angry."

00:09:51.287 --> 00:09:52.662
Attack.

00:09:53.454 --> 00:09:55.746
"You know, if you're going
to play the race card

00:09:55.787 --> 00:09:57.787
every time I try to give you feedback,

00:09:57.829 --> 00:10:01.079
it's going to make it really hard
for us to work together.